// `[list][0]: type` are all ordinary Python and all failed while the seed had to be a bare
// Id and the only call form was the argument-less one. This is the shape
// docs/abnf-dialect-gotchas.md calls "object creation must SEED the member chain".
Target      <~~ push(makeTargetRef(takeAll())) ~~>
            = TargetSeed { CallSfx | MethodSfx | TSubTup | TSlice | TIndex | TAttr } ;
